title: The Vorwärts Building
subtitle: 11 January. The Freikorps attack.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: crisis_january = 1 and crisis_time = 2
max-visits: 1

= The Vorwärts Building

At dawn on 11 January, Major von Stephani's Potsdam regiment opens fire on the *Vorwärts* building with field guns and mortars. The defenders send out seven men under a white flag to negotiate. The soldiers beat them and shoot them in the courtyard of the Dragoon barracks. Among them is the poet Wolfgang Fernbach.

That afternoon Noske marches into Berlin at the head of three thousand men. The other buildings are next.

[? if crisis_momentum >= 60 : Whole districts are still on our side. The soldiers move carefully in Moabit and Friedrichshain. ?][? if crisis_momentum < 40 : The working-class districts are quiet. The men in the buildings are alone. ?]

- @hold: Hold the buildings to the last.
- @retreat: Order a fighting retreat into the workers' districts.
- @terms: Surrender on terms, through the Independents.

@hold
subtitle: The Left Radicals' choice. A legend, and a massacre.
on-arrival: {!
Q.january_outcome = 1;
Q.crisis_momentum -= 10;
Q.militancy += 10;
Q.repression += 8;
Q.red_guards_strength -= 1;
Q.district_berlin_members -= 0.6;
Q.district_berlin_loyalty += 8;
Q.ultraleft_satisfaction += 8;
Q.lean_ultraleft += 2;
Q.lux_risk += 10;
Q.lieb_risk += 10;
!}

The buildings fall one by one under artillery fire. Prisoners are shot in the yards. The legend of the defenders of *Vorwärts* will live in every Berlin factory.

@retreat
subtitle: The Spartacist choice: save the cadres for the next fight.
on-arrival: {!
Q.january_outcome = Q.crisis_momentum >= 50 ? 2 : 1;
Q.crisis_momentum += 3;
Q.repression += 6;
Q.red_guards_strength -= 0.5;
Q.district_berlin_members -= 0.3;
Q.luxemburgist_satisfaction += 5;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 2;
!}

[? if january_outcome = 2 : Most of the fighters slip away through the courtyards with their rifles. The soldiers find empty rooms. ?][? if january_outcome = 1 : The retreat comes too late for many. The soldiers take the buildings, and their prisoners. ?]

@terms
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The Right's choice. Lives saved, if the government keeps its word.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids any deal with the social democrats.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.january_outcome = (Q.jan_talks == 1 || Q.crisis_momentum >= 55) ? 2 : 1;
Q.militancy -= 6;
Q.repression += (Q.january_outcome == 2) ? 2 : 8;
Q.uspd_relation += 6;
Q.unionist_satisfaction += 6;
Q.ultraleft_satisfaction -= 8;
Q.offensive_satisfaction -= 6;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
Q.district_berlin_loyalty -= 10;
Q.lux_risk -= 8;
Q.lieb_risk -= 8;
!}

[? if january_outcome = 2 : The Independents obtain a promise: no shootings, the fighters go home, the leaders face the courts. It is mostly kept. ?][? if january_outcome = 1 : The government has no reason to keep its promises. The men who come out with their hands up are beaten, and some are shot. ?]
